Modifiers for Restricted, Basic, Skilled, Expert are
here -2, 0, 1, 2, respectively. Modify above numbers
to get 4.5/3.5 (mace, Basic) vs. 2.5/4.5 (long sword,
Restricted). Then add the +1 enchantment of your mace
and you have 5.5/4.5 (mace) vs. 2.5/4.5 (longsword).

You see you mace is better for small monsters and as
good as long sword for large monsters. Mind that you
can advance mace further to Skilled to get 6.5/5.5,
and then the long sword is even worse.

